-- four children of a box, at four coordinates --
  north: 10,4
  east: 130,40
  south: 24,90
  west: 0,56
  each one carries what it was written: true
  and no two of them carry the same: true
-- a coordinate where nothing reads one --
  x in a <VStack> is refused: true
  and the message says where it belongs: true
  y in an <HStack> is refused: true
  and the message says where it belongs: true
  x in a <Grid> is refused: true
  and the message says where it belongs: true
-- a component's root, which had no parent when it was written --
  a <Box> takes it: true
  the same subtree in a <VStack> is refused: true
  and the message says where it belongs: true
  and a <VStack> takes a grow from one: true
-- and a root nothing contains at all --
  the requirement is still open: true
  and it names the attribute that asked: true
-- the far edges --
  right=12 bottom=3 reach the spec: 12,3
  right in a <VStack> is refused: true
  and the message says where it belongs: true
  x, right and width on one layer is refused: true
  and the message says why: true
  y, bottom and height_percent on one layer is refused: true
  and the message says why: true
  a negative x is refused: true
  and the message says why: true
  align on a layer is refused: true
  and the message says why: true
  align on a <Box> itself is refused: true
  and the message says why: true
  align_self on a child of a run is its own: true
